<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 206-5 V BORDER (117) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 206-5 V BORDER (117) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 206-5 in reply to Border's first innings of 117 at the close on the first day of their three-day match on Friday.</p>
</text>
